  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Recent versions of Microsoft Office include a number of new file extensions:  *.docx, *.pptx, *.xlsx, etc that are associated with new mime types.  The more common new file mime-types should be added to the FEDORA_HOME/server/config/mime-to-extensions.xml file so that the correct suffix is appended to the file name when the Content-Disposition header is generated for downloaded datastream content.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "See ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://technet.microsoft.com/en-us/library/ee309278%28office.12%29.aspx"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://technet.microsoft.com/en-us/library/ee309278%28office.12%29.aspx",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " for a list extensions and mime types.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
